Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Isto encerra a reunião de hoje do clube.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.81,0:00:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.51,0:00:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou exausta!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.52,0:00:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.37,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você vai fazer agora?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.98,0:00:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, que tal darmos um pulinho naquele café?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.62,0:00:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Presidente Akatsuki, bom trabalho.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.47,0:00:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.87,0:00:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenham uma ótima noite.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.76,0:00:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Adeus.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.19,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Adeus.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.74,0:00:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos comer umas panquecas.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.77,0:00:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa ideia, vamos lá!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.98,0:00:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O que aquela garota faz aqui?
