Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nemu?"
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.13,0:02:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que é a Hiiragi Nemu, uma das Magius?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.20,0:02:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Você conhece a Nemu-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.79,0:02:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, mas apenas ouvi o nome.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.22,0:02:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde o ouviu?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.87,0:02:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}De vez em quando, as Asas das Magius apareciam\N na barreira da Ai-chan para recuperar uma bruxa.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.21,0:03:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Me lembro delas dizerem algo sobre\N a cooperação de Hiiragi Nemu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.23,0:03:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A Nemu-chan está sendo\N forçada a ajudar as Magius?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.53,0:03:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que está sendo feita prisioneira?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.03,0:03:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Se for verdade, não podemos ignorar.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.79,0:03:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Podem ter sequestrado a Ui também.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.80,0:03:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, vamos capturar essas Penas Negras e fazê-las falar.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.83,0:03:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez saibam algo sobre a Nemu.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas como podemos procurá-las?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.64,0:03:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Devemos investigar outro boato?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.44,0:03:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Não há uma forma mais direta de procurar por elas?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.51,0:03:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Se soubéssemos, não teríamos tanto trabalho.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.08,0:03:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos pensar juntas no que fazer a seguir.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.94,0:03:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.82,0:03:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nesse caso, vou pesquisar outro boato também.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.35,0:03:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Com sua licença.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsukuyo-san, espere!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.46,0:03:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,O-O que você quer?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.68,0:04:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou Akatsuki Tsukuyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.71,0:04:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tenho relação alguma com a Amane Tsukuyo!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.69,0:04:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é mesmo a Amane Tsukuyo-san, não é?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.00,0:04:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma das Asas das—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.73,0:04:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ser um membro das Asas das\N Magius é um completo segredo!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.70,0:04:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, podemos conversar em outro lugar?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.58,0:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um interrogatório? Tortura?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.00,0:04:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu jamais faria algo desse tipo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.30,0:04:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero apenas conversar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:31.83,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\org(1343.9,1523.9)\pos(1304,503.2)\fnPotato Pancakes\fry1.36\frx0.14\frz0.06\blur0.8\c&H161C44&\fscx81\fscy81}C{\c&H1A234E&}a{\c&H1F2958&}f{\c&H243062&}é {\c&H2C3D76&}C{\c&H314480&}h{\c&H2C3D76&}a{\c&H28376C&}r{\c&H243062&}i{\c&H1F2958&}n{\c&H1A234E&}e{\c&H161C44&}l
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.18,0:04:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Você está sozinha hoje.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.22,0:04:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim. Eu queria conversar devidamente com você.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:53.23,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\org(629.3,814.1)\pos(1016,559.2)\fs50\fnFOT-RodinWanpakuProUB-NoKanji\b1\fry3.14\frx5.52\frz3.19\bord2\3c&H4471DE&\c&H4471DE&\blur0.8}BANBANZAI
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.60,0:04:53.23,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an5\org(629.3,814.1)\pos(1016,559.2)\fs50\fnFOT-RodinWanpakuProUB-NoKanji\b1\fry3.14\frx5.52\frz3.19\bord0\blur0.8\4a&HFF&\c&H12225D&}B{*\c&H0F1D55&}A{*\c&H0D174C&}N{\c&H0A1244&}BANZAI
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.02,0:04:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Está procurando por sua irmã mais nova?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.60,0:05:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A única pista que tenho são a\N Nemu-chan e a Touka-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.23,0:05:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que está me contando isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.26,0:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque preciso ver a Nemu-chan a qualquer custo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.62,0:05:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tsukasa-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.00,0:05:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,é a gêmea mais velha ou mais nova?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.96,0:05:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A mais nova.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.76,0:05:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Vocês parecem ser próximas.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:24.88,0:05:30.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\pos(204,632)\fscx100\fscy100\fnAvalonType Bold\fs54\blur5\c&H1D2022&\alpha&HC0&}Tsukasa
Dialogue: 3,0:05:24.88,0:05:30.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\pos(204,632)\fscx100\fscy100\fnAvalonType Bold\fs54\blur0.6\c&H1D2022&}Tsukasa
Dialogue: 2,0:05:24.88,0:05:30.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=4}{\pos(1764,632)\fscx100\fscy100\fnAvalonType Bold\fs54\blur5\c&H1D2022&\alpha&HC0&}Tsukuyo
Dialogue: 3,0:05:24.88,0:05:30.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=4}{\pos(1764,632)\fscx100\fscy100\fnAvalonType Bold\fs54\blur0.6\c&H1D2022&}Tsukuyo
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,É claro que somos.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.57,0:05:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tsukasa-chan é...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.12,0:05:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós somos...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.43,0:05:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,as duas únicas...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.31,0:05:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Se não me deixar ver a Nemu-chan,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.45,0:05:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,revelarei sua outra identidade para\N a Yachiyo-san e minhas amigas.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Está me ameaçando?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.98,0:05:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me importo se quiser interpretar assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.28,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=4}{\an5\pos(948,365)\fs20\fnLetters for Learners\c&H555555&\blur0.4\b0}Para a Yachiyo-san
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.28,0:05:49.28,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=4}{\an5\pos(948,365)\fs20\fnLetters for Learners\c&H555555&\blur0.4\b0}Para a Yachiyo-san
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.00,0:05:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,E caso eu não volte em segurança para a Pensão Mikazuki...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.58,0:05:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, me deixe ver a Nemu-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.59,0:06:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu faria qualquer coisa pelo bem da Ui.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.17,0:06:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendido. Seus sentimentos\N não fazem sentido para mim,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.40,0:06:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,mas, por favor, permita-me \Nfalar com a Mifuyu-san primeiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Descansos de copo?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensei que seria uma boa ideia
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.86,0:06:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}eu contribuir e comprar um conjunto para\N agradecer a Yachiyo-san por nos dar as canecas.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.59,0:06:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu acho uma ótima ideia!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.34,0:06:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso mostraria que somos um time!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.85,0:06:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu só tenho o dinheiro \N do Ano Novo que economizei.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.56,0:06:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sem problemas!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.89,0:06:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A Felicia e eu temos o dinheiro\N do trabalho no Banbanzai!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.73,0:07:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos surpreender a Mestra Yachiyo comprando um conjunto bem chique!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.39,0:07:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem, mas, por que o meu dinheirinho suado?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:17.70,Celular,,0,0,0,,{=171}{\an2\pos(1043.89,52.92)\alpha&H00&\blur8\fs95\b1\fnA-OTF Folk Pro B\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H8F&}(Yachiyo-san)
