Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.46,0:07:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Quais devemos comprar?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.83,0:07:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Há tantos.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Ei...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu gostei destes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.69,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,São lindos!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.68,0:07:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Legal!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.77,0:07:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Eles até que são bons, hein?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.03,0:07:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Acha que ela vai gostar?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,É claro que—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.41,0:07:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Que que isso aí?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.50,0:07:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Rosas?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.76,0:07:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Isto é...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.71,0:07:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Não me diga que...!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.98,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,É ela!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.93,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Não!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.03,0:08:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde estão os descansos de copo?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.84,0:08:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Achei!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.20,0:08:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquilo...!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.16,0:08:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,O que diabos você pensa que está fazendo, maldita?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.55,0:08:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.24,0:08:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda bem.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.10,0:08:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,O-O quê?
