Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.61,0:09:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, com certeza!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.23,0:09:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Agora, só precisamos entregar para a Yachiyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.25,0:09:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim!
