Dialogue: 2,0:17:52.21,0:17:54.22,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=184}{\an4\pos(154.27,145.013)\blur1.5\fs130\c&HFFFFFF&\fnThe Next Font\b1\fscx126\fscy131}KAMIHAMA\N{\fscx62\fscy80}MAPA DO DISTRITO DE SAKAE
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.75,0:17:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Distrito de Sakae...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.22,0:17:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Um prédio abandonado no Distrito de Sakae...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Só pode ser aqui.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.21,0:18:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.54,0:18:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vai contar para a Rena-chan e a Kaede-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,É claro que não.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.65,0:18:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A Kaede não está em condições disso.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.09,0:18:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que você devia contar para a Rena-chan, pelo menos.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.35,0:18:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Melhor do que ela descobrir depois, certo?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.69,0:18:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Já entendi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.76,0:18:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Está chovendo bastante.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.66,0:18:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana-chan, pegou a chave?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.42,0:18:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.80,0:18:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem, até mais.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.91,0:18:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Iroha, vamos te deixar para trás!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Esperem, estou indo!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.21,0:19:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Que chuva forte.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.87,0:19:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse é o Kyubey que conheci quando fiz meu contrato... não é?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.49,0:19:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas é menor do que eu me lembrava.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.90,0:19:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sempre dá as caras quando a Iroha está por perto, não é, Chibikyubey?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.32,0:19:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sempre que um boato aparece, ele está por perto.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.07,0:19:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando o toquei pela primeira vez, me lembrei da Ui.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.59,0:19:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza, vamos lá!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.54,0:19:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Este é o Museu das Memórias.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.21,0:19:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Está vazio...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.52,0:19:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é aquilo?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.50,0:20:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas o que diabos ele é, afinal?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.97,0:20:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele quem?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.36,0:20:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,O Chibikyubey.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.36,0:20:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, o Kyu-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.76,0:20:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu o chamava de Kyubey filhote.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.10,0:20:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, mas "Kyubey filhote" é meio brega.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.14,0:20:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos dar um nome a ele.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.32,0:20:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Então... Hachibey.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.55,0:20:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chibisukey!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.38,0:20:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi-chan...!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.84,0:20:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Muki-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.59,0:20:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossa, estou encharcada!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Espero que seja importante—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.47,0:20:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoko?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.43,0:20:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pensei que era melhor te contar o que houve com a Yachiyo-san e as outras há um ano.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.63,0:20:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que isso agora?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.93,0:21:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem nada a ver com a Rena.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.63,0:21:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem sim.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.90,0:21:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Toda e cada Garota Mágica tem relação com isso.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.02,0:21:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,O combinado era às 15:00 no Museu das Memórias.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.98,0:21:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Me surpreende vocês terem vindo mesmo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Touka-chan...!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.42,0:21:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Você realmente me conhece, hein?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.57,0:21:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,É um prazer, Tamaki Iroha.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.36,0:21:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu sou Satomi Touka.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.64,0:21:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma das Magius.
